P actions make_etude
P memjob 1048576
P memory_limit 1000.0
P mode interactif
P nomjob AsterStaticLoadWorstCase
P version stable
A args -max_base 300000
A memjeveux 2048.0
A tpmax 900.0
F comm AsterComplianceRobustLoadWorstCaseAdjointparam.in D  1
F comm AsterComplianceRobustLoadWorstCaseAdjoint.comm D  1
F mmed AsterComplianceRobustLoadWorstCaseAdjointinput.med D  20
F mess AsterComplianceRobustLoadWorstCaseAdjoint.log R  6
F rmed AsterComplianceRobustLoadWorstCaseAdjointoutput.rmed R  81
F resu AsterComplianceRobustLoadWorstCaseAdjoint.resu R  8
